{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Drive a Kei Truck through a collapsing Japan! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are being chased by aliens! Dodge attacks! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/DodgeTheAttack.gif?t=1746239956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dodge attacks with wall-riding!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It is very dangerous to actually run in this way, so please do not imitate it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/Run_everywhere.gif?t=1746239956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Recover the nitro by destruction!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I don't know why nitro is recovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/Destruction.gif?t=1746239956\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Counterattack on enemies!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/Battle.gif?t=1746239956\" /></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle with giant creatures!  <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/extras/GiantCreature.gif?t=1746239956\" /> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game progression is based on a stage-by-stage system.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are stages where smaller enemies appear and stages where you fight giant bosses. There are stages where no enemies appear. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Compete with other players on online leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game implements online leaderboards, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">where scores and times are recorded for each stage so that you can compete with other players.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/57b8ee126f75a6434fa4b601bfefa340d2aef26d.jpg"},{"name":"Endangered species","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/f12cfe0f9e1e06db2294ba9afea694354ce78238.jpg"},{"name":"Running away from the beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/cdc1e780cdaa45d831ea0296168da67aedc29bfc.jpg"},{"name":"Running away from endangered species","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/d3156ad52114b7f3085f8a33574fc25060c9c4f9.jpg"},{"name":"It's started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/74100e34026680ab1f6a3c94a7d38952bd9d97bb.jpg"},{"name":"destroying too much","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/70263e6905a999420dc70bf39955749e92170b90.jpg"},{"name":"This is the power of the kei truck!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/dfbc87f1d6d08261b0d2df6fb9153c57f0fc6b17.jpg"},{"name":"Still, the tires are not shaved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/d71a0780cc8a7487c1f4a3be052b0a49aa1bf472.jpg"},{"name":"Kei truck physics","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/ce13a2a2471b65c9b989a9d5bc8dfe7bc20f3643.jpg"},{"name":"Extremely fast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1556010/c3e73c99fd0e5a1e1ccc5393f507bb3b39381842.jpg"}],"total":13},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1556010?t=1746239956","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1556010/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746239956","capsule_image":"https://shared.